{"4018020":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Angels Online Global","steam_appid":4018020,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angels Online Global marks a major milestone in the franchise's 20 year history.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This edition faithfully preserves the game's classic gameplay and world while delivering a fully upgraded experience for modern players. Veterans can relive the pure excitement of their original adventures, while smoother combat, refined progression, and global servers open the door to a new era of cross-border exploration. <br> <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/f56e62245ab1fd5898650276ae920816.avif?t=1782272656\" width=740 height=85 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/4d908aab1097a14d14437f27f4e379cc.poster.avif?t=1782272656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/4d908aab1097a14d14437f27f4e379cc.webm?t=1782272656\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/4d908aab1097a14d14437f27f4e379cc.mp4?t=1782272656\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/885df21baffbbf5b489babd249108786.webp?t=1782272656\" width=740 height=50 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The four major factions reunite once again. Fight for honor, loyalty, and belief as iconic faction-based battles return in their most refined form.         <br>          <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/5de04ccedf5f79373c9addceda95f9d2.webp?t=1782272656\" width=740 height=50 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A highly flexible skill system allows players to freely combine abilities from a vast skill pool, creating personalized builds and defining their own combat roles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >      <br>     <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/9af429fa87dad66e57cd599f1eafbb18.webp?t=1782272656\" width=740 height=50 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extensive wardrobe system lets players shape their look without restrictions. From cute to heroic, simple to extravagant, your style is entirely yours.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       <br>     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/dfec94cb67442102f5bd51cba67b4649.webp?t=1782272656\" width=740 height=50 \/><\/span>Totem battles, personal housing, pet cultivation, mech mounts, and a variety of mini-games all make a full comeback, bringing classic gameplay together in one complete experience.        <br>        <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/3c7dd6713f53ba7910230696409c83fd.poster.avif?t=1782272656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/3c7dd6713f53ba7910230696409c83fd.webm?t=1782272656\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/3c7dd6713f53ba7910230696409c83fd.mp4?t=1782272656\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/70097837dd3caf1041393e63088ebebd.avif?t=1782272656\" width=740 height=85 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/edb7c20416097d98af92064a7afd27c8.webp?t=1782272656\" width=740 height=50 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With optimized level-up efficiency, early-game progression and training time have been significantly reduced, allowing players to access core and endgame content with ease.     <br>     <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/1f393cd1eb482e0df21090b34ef4f986.webp?t=1782272656\" width=740 height=50 \/><\/span>Significantly increased bag space removes restrictions on dungeon runs and loot collection, making exploration smoother and more enjoyable.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/5d511b3731cedb0f035238422b60c0c7.poster.avif?t=1782272656\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/5d511b3731cedb0f035238422b60c0c7.webm?t=1782272656\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4018020\/extras\/5d511b3731cedb0f035238422b60c0c7.mp4?t=1782272656\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"http